docs {
  Inspection slots — past dates, so the inspections that follow look like
  genuine history (not "scheduled for next week").

  Slot service only validates `endsAt > startsAt`; past dates are allowed.

  ⚠️ NOT idempotent — same time-window on same listing = 409 (GiST EXCLUDE).
}
